# Illustrative. This file only has force once a repository ruleset requires
# review from code owners; nothing in this repository enforces it today.
#
# The intent: app makers may propose changes under apps/, while the kernel,
# the validator, the registry, the pipeline and dependencies require platform
# review.

/platform/            @platform-owners
/.github/             @platform-owners
/package.json         @platform-owners
/package-lock.json    @platform-owners
/CODEOWNERS           @platform-owners
/SECURITY_BOUNDARY.md @platform-owners

/apps/                @ops-app-makers @platform-owners
